==Serbo-Croatian==

===Etymology===
From {{proto|Slavic|pъtica|lang=sh}}, from {{proto|Indo-European|peta-|fly|lang=sh}}. Cognate with {{etyl|en|-}} {{term|feather|lang=en}}, {{term|pen|lang=en}}, {{etyl|grc|-}} {{term|πέτομαι|lang=grc}}, {{term|πτέρυξ|lang=grc}} (whence {{term|pterodactyl}}, {{term|archæopteryx}}, {{etyl|el|-}} {{term|φτερό|lang=el}}, {{term|πτηνό|lang=el}}), {{etyl|la|-}} {{term|peto|petō|lang=la}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ptîtsa/|lang=sh}}
* {{hyphenation|pti|ca}}

===Noun===
{{sh-noun|g=f|head=ptȉca|r|птица|пти̏ца}}

# [[bird]]

